    "chunk_text": "\u00feor of \u00fe\u00e6m carcerne, Se halga Andreas him andswarede, & he cw\u00e6\u00f0, Min Drihten H\u00e6lende Crist, hu m\u00e6g ic hit on \u00ferim Ac ma wen is \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu onsende \u00feinne engel, se hit m\u00e6g hr\u00e6dlicor geferan; for\u00f0on, min Drihten, \u00feu wast Drihten Crist him tocw\u00e6\u00f0, Andreas, gehyre me, for\u00f0on \u00fee ic \u00fee geworhte, & ic \u00feinne si\u00fef\u00e6t Gang nu to \u00f0\u00e6s s\u00e6s waro\u00f0e mid \u00feinum discipulum; & \u00feu \u00fe\u00e6r gemetst scip on \u00fe\u00e6m waro\u00f0e; & astig on & mid \u00fey \u00fee he \u00feis cw\u00e6\u00f0 Drihten H\u00e6lend \u00f0agit w\u00e6s sprecende & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Sib mid \u00fee & mid eallum & he astag on heofenas. Tunc Sanctus Andreas surgens mane abiit ad mare cum discipulis suis, et uidit nauiculam in litore, et & he w\u00e6s gefeonde myclum gefean, & him to cw\u00e6\u00fe, Bro\u00feor, hwyder wille feran mid \u00feys medmyclum Drihten H\u00e6lende Crist w\u00e6s on \u00fe\u00e6m scipe swa se steorre\u00fera, & his twegen englas mid him \u00fea w\u00e6ron Drihten Crist him \u00fea to cw\u00e6\u00f0, On Mermedonia ceastre. Se halga Andreas him ondswerede & cw\u00e6\u00f0, Bro\u00f0or, onfoh us mid eow on \u00fe\u00e6t scip, & gel\u00e6da\u00fe us on Drihten him to cw\u00e6\u00f0, Ealle men fleo\u00fe of \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre; to hwam wille ge \u00feyder faran? Se halga Andreas him andswerede, he cw\u00e6\u00fe, Medmycel \u00e6rende we \u00feyder habba\u00f0, & us is \u00feearf \u00fe\u00e6t we Drihten H\u00e6lende Crist him to",
